# Density Compare
# Barium (Ba) — real density 3.51 g/cm³. equal masses: Barium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Barium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 13.1mm color: #00c900 at (-20mm, 6.6mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 28.0 g — the water cube is the reference
